  "snp5.19:1.1": "",
  "snp5.19:1.2": "Piṅgiyo ",
  "snp5.19:1.3": "yathā addakkhi, tathā akkhāsi ",
  "snp5.19:1.4": "vimalo bhūrimedhaso, ",
  "snp5.19:1.5": "nikkāmo nibbano nātho ",
  "snp5.19:1.6": "kissa hetu musā bhaṇe. 1132. ",
  "snp5.19:2.1": "Pahīnamalamohassa ",
  "snp5.19:2.2": "mānamakkhappahāyino ",
  "snp5.19:2.3": "handāhaṃ kittayissāmi ",
  "snp5.19:2.4": "giraṃ vaṇṇūpasaṃhitaṃ. 1133. ",
  "snp5.19:3.1": "Tamonudo Buddho samantacakkhu ",
  "snp5.19:3.2": "lokantagū sabbabhavātivatto ",
  "snp5.19:3.3": "anāsavo sabbadukkhappahīno ",
  "snp5.19:3.4": "saccavhayo brahme upāsito me. 1134. ",
  "snp5.19:4.1": "Dijo yathā kubbanakaṃ pahāya ",
  "snp5.19:4.2": "bahupphalaṃ kānanaṃ āvaseyya, ",
  "snp5.19:4.3": "evam p' ahaṃ appadasse pahāya ",
  "snp5.19:4.4": "mahodadhiṃ haṃsa-r-iv' ajjhapatto. 1135. ",
  "snp5.19:5.1": "Ye 'me pubbe viyākaṃsu ",
  "snp5.19:5.2": "huraṃ Gotamasāsanā: ",
  "snp5.19:5.3": "‘icc-āsi, iti bhavissati,' ",
  "snp5.19:5.4": "sabban taṃ itihītihaṃ, ",
  "snp5.19:5.5": "sabban taṃ takkavaḍḍhanaṃ. 1136. ",
  "snp5.19:6.1": "Eko tamanud' āsīno ",
  "snp5.19:6.2": "jātimā so pabhaṃkaro ",
  "snp5.19:6.3": "Gotamo bhūripaññāṇo, ",
  "snp5.19:6.4": "Gotamo bhūrimedhaso, 1137. ",
  "snp5.19:7.1": "yo me dhammam adesesi ",
  "snp5.19:7.2": "sandiṭṭhikam akālikaṃ ",
  "snp5.19:7.3": "taṇhakkhayam anītikaṃ, ",
  "snp5.19:7.4": "yassa n' atthi upamā kvaci\". 1138. ",
  "snp5.19:8.1": "\"Kin nu tamhā vippavasasi ",
  "snp5.19:8.2": "muhuttam api Piṅgiya ",
  "snp5.19:8.3": "Gotamā bhūripaññāṇā, ",
  "snp5.19:8.4": "Gotamā bhūrimedhasā, 1139. ",
  "snp5.19:9.1": "yo te dhammam adesesi ",
  "snp5.19:9.2": "sandiṭṭhikam akālikaṃ ",
  "snp5.19:9.3": "taṇhakkhayam anītikaṃ, ",
  "snp5.19:9.4": "yassa n' atthi upamā kvaci\". 1140. ",
  "snp5.19:10.1": "\"Nāhaṃ tamhā vippavasāmi ",
  "snp5.19:10.2": "muhuttam api brāhmaṇa ",
  "snp5.19:10.3": "Gotamā bhūripaññāṇā, ",
  "snp5.19:10.4": "Gotamā bhūrimedhasā, 1141. ",
  "snp5.19:11.1": "yo me dhammam adesesi ",
  "snp5.19:11.2": "sandiṭṭhikam akālikaṃ ",
  "snp5.19:11.3": "taṇhakkhayam anītikaṃ, ",
  "snp5.19:11.4": "yassa n' atthi upamā kvaci. 1142. ",
  "snp5.19:12.1": "Passāmi naṃ manasā cakkhunā va ",
  "snp5.19:12.2": "rattindivaṃ brāhmaṇa appamatto, ",
  "snp5.19:12.3": "namassamāno vivasemi rattiṃ, ",
  "snp5.19:12.4": "ten' eva maññāmi avippavāsaṃ. 1143. ",
  "snp5.19:13.1": "Saddhā ca pītī ca mano satī ca ",
  "snp5.19:13.2": "nāpenti me Gotamasāsanamhā, ",
  "snp5.19:13.3": "yaṃ yaṃ disaṃ vajati bhūripañño, ",
  "snp5.19:13.4": "sa tena ten' eva nato 'ham asmi. 1144. ",
  "snp5.19:14.1": "Jiṇṇassa me dubbalathāmakassa ",
  "snp5.19:14.2": "ten' eva kāyo na paleti tattha, ",
  "snp5.19:14.3": "saṃkappayattāya vajāmi niccaṃ, ",
  "snp5.19:14.4": "mano hi me brāhmaṇa tena yutto. 1145. ",
  "snp5.19:15.1": "Paṃke sayāno pariphandamāno ",
  "snp5.19:15.2": "dīpā dīpaṃ uppalaviṃ, ",
  "snp5.19:15.3": "ath' addasāsiṃ Sambuddhaṃ ",
  "snp5.19:15.4": "oghatiṇṇam anāsavaṃ\". 1146. ",
  "snp5.19:16.1": "\"Yathā ahū Vakkali muttasaddho ",
  "snp5.19:16.2": "Bhadrāvudho Āḷavi-Gotamo ca, ",
  "snp5.19:16.3": "evam eva tvam pi pamuñcassu saddhaṃ: ",
  "snp5.19:16.4": "gamissasi tvaṃ Piṅgiya maccudheyyapāraṃ\". 1147. ",
  "snp5.19:17.1": "\"Esa bhiyyo pasīdāmi ",
  "snp5.19:17.2": "sutvāna munino vaco: ",
  "snp5.19:17.3": "vivattacchaddo Sambuddho ",
  "snp5.19:17.4": "akhilo paṭibhānavā 1148. ",
  "snp5.19:18.1": "adhideve abhiññāya ",
  "snp5.19:18.2": "sabbaṃ vedi parovaraṃ, ",
  "snp5.19:18.3": "pañhān' antakaro Satthā ",
  "snp5.19:18.4": "kaṃkhīnaṃ paṭijānataṃ. 1149. ",
  "snp5.19:19.1": "Asaṃhīraṃ asaṃkuppaṃ, ",
  "snp5.19:19.2": "yassa n' atthi upamā kvaci, ",
  "snp5.19:19.3": "addhā gamissāmi, na m' ettha kaṃkhā, ",
  "snp5.19:19.4": "evaṃ maṃ dhārehi adhimuttacittan\" ti ",
  "snp5.19:19.5": "PĀRĀYANAVAGGO NIṬṬHITO. ",
